hpc:Job a owl:Class .
hpc:Partition a owl:Class .
hpc:User a owl:Class .
hpc:Resource a owl:Class .
hpc:Node a owl:Class .
hpc:State a owl:EnumeredClass ;
  rdfs:subClassOf owl:Class ;
  rdfs:subClassOf hpc:JobState .
hpc:JobState rdf:type owl:Class .

hpc:hasJobID a owl:ObjectProperty ;
  rdfs:domain hpc:Job ;
  rdfs:range xsd:string .
hpc:isInPartition a owl:ObjectProperty ;
  rdfs:domain hpc:Job ;
  rdfs:range hpc:Partition .
hpc:isUser a owl:ObjectProperty ;
  rdfs:domain hpc:Job ;
  rdfs:range hpc:User .
hpc:hasState a owl:ObjectProperty ;
  rdfs:domain hpc:Job ;
  rdfs:range hpc:State .
hpc:startTime a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
  rdfs:domain hpc:Job ;
  rdfs:range xsd:time .
hpc:hasNodes a owl:ObjectProperty ;
  rdfs:domain hpc:Job ;
  rdfs:range hpc:Node .
hpc:isInNodeList a owl:ObjectProperty ;
  rdfs:domain hpc:Node ;
  rdfs:range xsd:string .
hpc:hasReason a owl:DatatypeProperty ;
  rdfs:domain hpc:Node ;
  rdfs:range xsd:string .

hpc:Running a hpc:JobState .
hpc:Queued a hpc:JobState .
hpc:Pending a hpc:JobState .
hpc:Resource a hpc:Resource .
hpc:Node a hpc:Resource .
```

This ontology fragment represents the classes `Job`, `Partition`, `User`, `Resource`, `Node`, and `State`, as well as the properties `hasJobID`, `isInPartition`, `isUser`, `hasState`, `startTime`, `hasNodes`, `isInNodeList`, and `hasReason`. The `State` class is an enumerated class with subclasses `Running`, `Queued`, and `Pending`. The `Resource` class has subclass `Node`.
